    "answer": "the-first",
    "mnemonic": "You've seen <ja>一番</ja> (number one), so what in the world is this eye on the end? This eye (<ja>目</ja>) signifies the order. So, add this to \"number one\" and you have the <vocabulary>first thing</vocabulary> / <vocabulary>the first</vocabulary>.",
